      "label": "Paragraph3 — Value",
      "default": "The best part about ThePhotoStick® OMNI is that you only need one of them for all your devices! ThePhotoStick® OMNI works on:<br><br><strong>•&nbsp;Smartphones</strong> - iPhone &amp; Android<br><strong>•&nbsp;Computers</strong> - Mac &amp; PC (Windows)<br><strong>•&nbsp;Tablets</strong> - iPad &amp; Android<br><br>This means you can now safely store, access, and share ALL of your precious photo and video memories in a matter of minutes… no matter where they are… with ONE device. It’s going to prevent so many irreplaceable photos &amp; videos from being lost!"
